<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="First Heart Break"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Negai EP"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU901701957"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538281340"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>MIREI</songwriter><songwriter>Victor Sågfors</songwriter><songwriter>Derrick Hoh &amp; Timo Oiva</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">一红一蓝的水杯 你借我穿过的T恤</text><text for="L2">两人曾生活过的房间 如今只剩我一人</text><text for="L3">曾经钟爱的那缕香水气息</text><text for="L4">在常常相约的车站 悄悄飘散开来 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(飘散开来)</span></text><text for="L5">别轻描淡写地说 一切都能彻底遗忘</text><text for="L6">明明 连熬过今天 都痛苦得难以承受 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(明明)</span></text><text for="L7">那是我的初恋 我曾爱得那样深</text><text for="L8">甚至觉得 就算被你玩弄也无所谓</text><text for="L9">可其实 在心底我曾一直坚信</text><text for="L10">相信你也是爱我的</text><text for="L11">你在哪里 紧紧抱住我好吗</text><text for="L12">我好寂寞啊</text><text for="L13">哪怕被别人说我有多傻</text><text for="L14">我也依然 无法恨你</text><text for="L15">这是我人生的第一次心碎</text><text for="L16">游乐园 水族馆 烟火 璀璨的灯海</text><text for="L17">无论去向何方 只要是两个人就好</text><text for="L18">在LINE上吵过的架 赌气连发的表情包</text><text for="L19">如今依然闪耀的 却只有回忆了呢 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(只有回忆了呢)</span></text><text for="L20">别那么轻易地对我说 一切都可以忘掉</text><text for="L21">明明 光是熬过今天 就已经痛苦万分</text><text for="L22">那是我的初恋 我曾爱得那样深</text><text for="L23">我曾坚信 你和我是心意相通的</text><text for="L24">无论如何 我都绝不想承认</text><text for="L25">世上根本 就没有什么永远</text><text for="L26">你在哪里 快紧紧抱住我啊</text><text for="L27">我真的好寂寞</text><text for="L28">无论别人骂我有多么傻</text><text for="L29">我也还是 没办法去讨厌你</text><text for="L30">我人生的第一次心碎</text><text for="L31">心碎了 心碎了</text><text for="L32">我迎来了人生的第一次心碎 心碎了</text><text for="L33">心碎了 彻底碎了</text><text for="L34">我经历了人生的第一次心碎 心碎了</text><text for="L35">那是我的初恋 我曾那么深深爱过</text><text for="L36">甚至觉得 哪怕只是被你玩弄也无所谓</text><text for="L37">可其实 在心底我曾一直相信</text><text for="L38">相信你也是爱我的</text><text for="L39">你在哪里 紧紧抱住我好吗</text><text for="L40">我好寂寞啊</text><text for="L41">哪怕被别人说我有多傻</text><text for="L42">我也依然 无法狠下心恨你</text><text for="L43">这是我人生的第一次心碎 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(我一生仅有的一次心碎)</span></text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:49.221"><div begin="0:12.728" end="3:49.221"><p begin="0:12.728" end="0:17.268" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.728" end="0:12.958">赤</span><span begin="0:12.958" end="0:13.318">と</span><span begin="0:13.318" end="0:13.718">青</span><span begin="0:13.718" end="0:13.908">の</span><span begin="0:13.908" end="0:14.418">カッ</span><span begin="0:14.418" end="0:14.788">プ</span> <span begin="0:15.068" end="0:15.238">貸</span><span begin="0:15.238" end="0:15.378">し</span><span begin="0:15.378" end="0:15.638">て</span><span begin="0:15.638" end="0:15.868">く</span><span begin="0:15.868" end="0:16.088">れ</span><span begin="0:16.088" end="0:16.318">た</span><span begin="0:16.318" end="0:16.768">T</span><span begin="0:16.768" end="0:17.148">シャ</span><span begin="0:17.148" end="0:17.268">ツ</span></p><p begin="0:17.498" end="0:21.738" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.498" end="0:18.118">二</span><span begin="0:18.118" end="0:18.238">人</span><span begin="0:18.238" end="0:18.468">の</span><span begin="0:18.468" end="0:18.788">部</span><span begin="0:18.788" end="0:19.188">屋</span><span begin="0:19.188" end="0:19.488">に</span><span begin="0:19.488" end="0:20.178">一</span><span begin="0:20.178" end="0:20.348">人</span><span begin="0:20.348" end="0:21.388">き</span><span begin="0:21.388" end="0:21.738">り</span></p><p begin="0:22.234" end="0:26.784" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.234" end="0:22.414">気</span><span begin="0:22.414" end="0:22.664">に</span><span begin="0:22.664" end="0:22.854">入っ</span><span begin="0:22.854" end="0:22.974">て</span><span begin="0:22.974" end="0:23.314">つ</span><span begin="0:23.314" end="0:23.534">け</span><span begin="0:23.534" end="0:23.994">て</span><span begin="0:23.994" end="0:24.384">た</span> <span begin="0:24.664" end="0:24.954">香</span><span begin="0:24.954" end="0:25.294">水</span><span begin="0:25.294" end="0:25.424">の</span><span begin="0:25.424" end="0:26.024">香</span><span begin="0:26.024" end="0:26.374">り</span><span begin="0:26.374" end="0:26.784">が</span></p><p begin="0:27.067" end="0:32.397" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.067" end="0:27.187">よ</span><span begin="0:27.187" end="0:27.357">く</span><span begin="0:27.357" end="0:27.597">待</span><span begin="0:27.597" end="0:27.807">ち</span><span begin="0:27.887" end="0:28.137">合</span><span begin="0:28.137" end="0:28.277">わ</span><span begin="0:28.277" end="0:28.777">せし</span><span begin="0:28.777" end="0:29.267">てた</span><span begin="0:29.267" end="0:30.047">駅</span><span begin="0:30.047" end="0:30.337">で</span><span begin="0:30.617" end="0:30.987">し</span><span begin="0:30.987" end="0:31.337">たん</span><span begin="0:31.337" end="0:32.397">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="0:31.770" end="0:32.149">(し</span><span begin="0:32.149" end="0:32.520">たん</span><span begin="0:32.520" end="0:33.809">だ)</span></span></p><p begin="0:32.927" end="0:40.167" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.927" end="0:33.587">全</span><span begin="0:33.587" end="0:35.277">て</span><span begin